## SQ-HH-1534 | tilling III spreads over 5x5 (sneak state printed before and after the use)
> gamerule randomTickSpeed 0
> fill 31060 -61 30036 31068 -61 30044 minecraft:grass_block
> fill 31060 -60 30036 31068 -60 30044 minecraft:air
> tp G 31064 -60 30032 -45 0
sleep 1
> item replace entity G weapon.mainhand with minecraft:iron_hoe{Enchantments:[{id:"hearthandharvest:tilling",lvl:3s}]}
> zhh5 sneak G on
> zsneak G
> pbot use G 31064 -61 30040 up
> zsneak G
> zhh5 sneak G off
> zq count 31060 -61 30036 31068 -61 30044 minecraft:farmland
